--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL MATRIX
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Fitur               | Manager                    | Karyawan
  --------------------+----------------------------+---------------------------
  Dashboard           | Lihat semua (tim)          | Lihat sendiri (Hari Saya)
  Live Tracking       | Peta semua karyawan        | ❌ (redirect)
  Lacak Kunjungan     | Semua kunjungan            | Kunjungan sendiri
  Karyawan            | CRUD semua karyawan        | ❌ (redirect)
  Outlet              | CRUD semua outlet          | ❌ (redirect)
  Produk              | CRUD semua produk          | ❌ (redirect)
  Stok Outlet         | CRUD semua stok             | ❌ (redirect)
  Absensi             | Rekap semua karyawan        | Riwayat sendiri
  Ijin & Cuti         | Approve/Reject semua       | Ajukan & lihat sendiri
  Mobile View          | Pilih karyawan mana pun    | Hanya diri sendiri


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ARSITEKTUR FILE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  main.pjs                    Config file (metadata, import footer)
  index.html                  App shell (CSS, HTML container, script loader)
  src/app.js                  Main module (router, state, renderers, handlers)
  src/lib/db.js               Database layer (localStorage, CRUD, auth, v3)
  src/lib/utils.js            Utilities (format, badges, distance, uid, currency)
  src/data/seed.js            Seed data (employees, outlets, visits, attendance,
                              accounts, products, leaveTypes, leaves, stocks)
  src/types/index.js          JSDoc type definitions
  CHANGE.log                  This file


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CATATAN TEKNIS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Database: localStorage key "proqtrack_db_v3" (auto-migrate dari v1→v2→v3)
  - Auth: email case-insensitive, password plain text (demo only — tidak untuk production)
  - Map: Leaflet 1.9.4 dari unpkg CDN, tile OpenStreetMap
  - Simulasi live movement: marker di-nudge setiap 5 detik (random offset)
  - Mobile view: phone mockup 390x780px, 4 tab (Beranda, Kunjungan, Rute, Profil)
  - Responsive: breakpoint 1024px (grid collapse), 768px (sidebar slide-in)
  - Stock alert: quantity <= minStock → highlight merah + sidebar badge
  - Leave approval: manager approve/reject, approverId & approvedAt tercatat
  - Leave auto-calc: durasi hari dihitung dari range tanggal (onchange)

